# brainstorming

Apply the brainstorming skill when the request matches its scope.

Capabilities:
- divergent ideation
- reframing
- clustering
- prioritization
- experiment framing

Stop when: The problem is framed, ideas are captured and clustered, priorities are justified, and next experiments have owners and acceptance criteria.
